# Caching Dependencies
##jenkins pipeline - cache mavan dependencies
you will learn how **to resuse the dependencies to speed up the build**

pipeline{
    agent any
    environment{
        INSTITUTE_NAME: "Pathnex"
    }
    stages{
        stage('checkout')
        {
            steps{
                git url: 'https://github.com/pathnex/sample-java-app.git'
            }
        }
        stage('build')
        {
            steps{
                sh '''
                if[-d ".m2"]; then
                echo "chaching dependencies"
                else
                echo"mavan clean complie"
                fi
                ''' 
            }
        }
    }
}

